    \u2014 Night Security Guard\n\u2022 <b>Paul Gabriel Camacho</b> \u2014 Art Gallery
    Owner\n\u2022 <b>Shanaia Ortega</b> \u2014 Lead Software Developer\n\u2022 <b>Shan
    Jaraba</b> \u2014 Coffee Shop Manager\n\u2022 <b>Kurt Miguel Ancheta</b> \u2014
    Startup Founder\n\u2022 <b>Kyle Gabriel Pastrana & Miguel Borja</b> \u2014 Detective
    Agency\n\n<i>Built with Unity 2D Engine (URP)</i>"
